   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route114_EventScript_1507F1",
   "texts": {
    "Route114_Text_1BC05B": "Yodelayhihoo!\\p... ...\\pYou're supposed to shout\\n“yodelayhihoo” since it doesn't\\lecho here!$",
    "Route114_Text_1BC0B5": "Yodelayhihoo!$",
    "Route114_Text_1BC0C3": "When I was a wee tyke, I believed there\\nwas someone copying me and shouting\\lback, “Yodelayhihoo.”$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 4,
   "x": 30,
   "y": 72,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_HIKER",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_UP_AND_LEFT",
   "range": [
    0,
    0
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route114_EventScript_150808",
   "texts": {
    "Route114_Text_1BC125": "If you're not prepared, you shouldn't\\nbe up in the mountains!$",
    "Route114_Text_1BC163": "The mountains are unforgiving...$",
    "Route114_Text_1BC184": "In the winter, mountains turn deadly\\nwith blizzards and avalanches.$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 5,
   "x": 22,
   "y": 50,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_CAMPER",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_RIGHT",
   "range": [
    0,
    0
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route114_EventScript_15081F",
   "texts": {
    "Route114_Text_1BC1C8": "Camping's fun! You can fish, roast\\nmarshmallows, and tell spooky stories!\\pBut the best of all are the POKéMON\\nbattles!$",
    "Route114_Text_1BC23F": "Way too strong!$",
    "Route114_Text_1BC24F": "I think it's great that I can go\\ncamping with my POKéMON.$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 6,
   "x": 19,
   "y": 35,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_PICNICKER",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_LOOK_AROUND",
   "range": [
    0,
    0
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route114_EventScript_150836",
   "texts": {
    "Route114_Text_1BC289": "I need to exercise after a meal.\\nLet's have a match!$",
    "Route114_Text_1BC2BE": "Oh, no!$",
    "Route114_Text_1BC2C6": "I just had a tasty meal.\\nI'm getting drowsy...$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 7,
   "x": 20,
   "y": 56,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_MANIAC",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_UP",
   "range": [
    0,
    0
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route114_EventScript_15084D",
   "texts": {
    "Route114_Text_1BC2F5": "Ufufufufufu...\\nWant to battle against my POKéMON?$",
    "Route114_Text_1BC327": "M-My POKéMON...$",
    "Route114_Text_1BC337": "A big body that's all lumpy and hard,\\nenormous horns, and vicious fangs...\\pUfufufufu...\\nI wish I had a POKéMON like that...$"
   },
