   "texts": {
    "Route114_Text_170154": "All my POKéMON does is ROAR...\\nNo one dares to come near me...\\pSigh... If you would, please take\\nthis TM away...$",
    "Route114_Text_1701C5": "TM05 contains ROAR.\\nA ROAR sends POKéMON scurrying.$"
