   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route114_EventScript_150733",
   "texts": {
    "Route114_Text_1C5803": "I'm gathering BERRIES so I can win a\\nPOKéMON CONTEST.\\pIf you'd like, I'll share one with you.$",
    "Route114_Text_1C5861": "Good luck to you, too!$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 15,
   "x": 23,
   "y": 20,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_FISHERMAN",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_DOWN",
   "range": [
    0,
    0
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route114_EventScript_1508E0",
   "texts": {
    "Route114_Text_1BC6EC": "I like to fish. But I also like to\\nbattle!\\pIf anyone challenges me, I'm there,\\neven if I'm fishing.$",
    "Route114_Text_1BC750": "I like to battle, but that doesn't\\nmean I'm good at it...$",
    "Route114_Text_1BC78A": "This time I'll do it!\\pI always think that, so I can't walk\\naway from fishing or POKéMON.$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 16,
   "x": 19,
   "y": 26,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_FISHERMAN",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_LEFT",
   "range": [
    0,
    0
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route114_EventScript_1508C9",
   "texts": {
    "Route114_Text_1BC5FC": "If we were fishing, you wouldn't stand\\na chance against me.\\lSo, bring on your POKéMON!$",
    "Route114_Text_1BC653": "If we were fishing, I would've won...$",
    "Route114_Text_1BC679": "I think I'll try my luck at landing\\na big one at METEOR FALLS.\\pThere has to be something in there.\\nI just know it.$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 17,
   "x": 30,
   "y": 58,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_MAN_6",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_ROTATE_COUNTERCLOCKWISE",
